items/thm-fd-x07.md:24:scope: "Given smooth Stokes-difference fields, zero trace and an explicit Poincare bound, the residual controls the L2 velocity and gradient; the periodic channel has the direct bound C=h. The result asserts no solution existence, exterior-domain estimate, or Reynolds-number-only error. The bounded-domain divergence step assumes AC_omega."
