items/thm-fd-smooth-vorticity-identities.md:70:3.1 Multiply the scalar equation in step 2.1 by $\omega$ and integrate over the periodic torus. The transport integral is $\frac12\int u\cdot\nabla(\omega^2)\,d\mu=0$ by periodicity and $\operatorname{div}u=0$; integration by parts gives $\int\omega\Delta\omega\,d\mu=-\|\nabla\omega\|_2^2$. This proves the enstrophy identity. [given, step 2.1, algebra]
