+---
+id: lem-qftx-su2-compact-nonabelian-invariant-form
+kind: lemma
+title: Compactness and normalized invariant form for SU(2)
+status: draft
+origin: session
+dependency_level: 0
+domain: mathematics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
